  cookingInstructions:
  - Slice the pork belly sliced
  - Slice the chicken liver sliced
  - Slice the kikiam sliced
  - Slice the onion sliced
  - Slice the garlic sliced
  - Turn the stove to high heat
  - Put the pan on the stove
  - Add 1/4 cup of cooking oil
  - Add the onion
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula"
  - Add the pork
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula"
  - Add the kikiam
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula"
  - Add the chicken liver
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula"
  - Add pork bouillon
  - ' Add water'
  - Add 1/4 cup of soy sauce
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula"
  - Cover it with pan lid cook until simmering
  - Add lomi noodles
  - Cover it with pan lid until simmer
  - 'Add cassava 1 tbsp '
  - Cover it with pan lid until simmer
  - Add eggs beaten
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula"
  - Turn the stove to medium heat
  - Cover it with pan lid until simmer
  - Add 1/4 tsp of salt
  - Add 1/4 tsp of pepper
